Hi all

Has anyone ever started a Lojban user group?  I'm getting interest from a
few colleagues of mine, and we're meeting next week to discuss possibly
starting one.

I read the record on the southeast Michigan user group (
http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=southeast+Michigan+Lojban+group),
but does anyone have any specific advice?

I was thinking maybe we could produce some audio material, especially
something focused on the eternal problem of learning a new language:
vocabulary.  This should work well, we all have in common that we have some
sort of commute, which means audio material could fill up the dullness of
traffic with something interesting.

Oh and by the way, we're in Cape Town South Africa, so if you live or work
nearby let me know.

Cheers!
Johan

